<!-- ddPCR — particionamiento digital; gotitas positivas y conteo absoluto -->
<div class="wrapper">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 280 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Animación ddPCR">

    <!-- Label top -->
    <text x="140" y="13" fill="#64748b" font-size="7.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">~20.000 gotitas particionadas</text>

    <!-- Grid of droplets: 10 cols × 6 rows — all appear in phase 1 -->
    {(() => {
      const positives = new Set([2, 5, 9, 13, 17, 21, 24, 28, 33, 37, 41, 45, 48, 53, 57])
      const items = []
      for (let row = 0; row < 6; row++) {
        for (let col = 0; col < 10; col++) {
          const idx = row * 10 + col
          const cx = 28 + col * 24
          const cy = 28 + row * 20
          const isPos = positives.has(idx)
          items.push(
            <circle
              cx={cx}
              cy={cy}
              r="8"
              fill={isPos ? 'rgba(57,255,20,0.25)' : 'rgba(30,58,95,0.6)'}
              stroke={isPos ? '#39ff14' : '#1e3a5f'}
              stroke-width={isPos ? '1.2' : '0.8'}
              class={isPos ? 'droplet-pos' : 'droplet-neg'}
            />
          )
        }
      }
      return items
    })()}

    <!-- Phase 3: absolute count badge -->
    <g class="count-badge">
      <rect x="88" y="138" width="104" height="18" rx="5" fill="rgba(57,255,20,0.1)" stroke="rgba(57,255,20,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
      <text x="140" y="150" fill="#39ff14" font-size="7.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">15 copias/µL — absoluto</text>
    </g>

    <!-- Technique badge -->
    <rect x="202" y="2" width="70" height="14" rx="4" fill="rgba(57,255,20,0.1)" stroke="rgba(57,255,20,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <text x="237" y="12" fill="#39ff14" font-size="7.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">ddPCR</text>
  </svg>

  <!-- Leyenda estática -->
  <div class="legend">
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldot" style="background:rgba(57,255,20,0.3);border:1px solid #39ff14"></span>gotita verde = diana detectada (positiva)</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldot" style="background:rgba(30,58,95,0.6);border:1px solid #1e3a5f"></span>gotita oscura = vacía (negativa)</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="lnum">#</span>conteo = concentración absoluta sin curva estándar</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Pasos sincronizados (loop 9s) -->
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step s1">
      <span class="snum">1/3</span>
      <p>La muestra se fracciona en ~20.000 microgotas. Cada gota recibe estadísticamente 0 ó 1 molécula de ADN diana (distribución de Poisson).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s2">
      <span class="snum">2/3</span>
      <p>PCR amplifica el ADN dentro de cada gota de forma independiente. Las que contienen diana emiten fluorescencia (verde brillante).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s3">
      <span class="snum">3/3</span>
      <p>Conteo digital: positivas ÷ total = concentración <strong>absoluta</strong>. Sin curva estándar. Máxima precisión para ctDNA de baja frecuencia.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .wrapper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  svg { width: 100%; }

  .legend {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .leg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .ldot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .lnum {
    display: inline-block; width: 14px; text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold; color: #39ff14; flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .steps { position: relative; height: 5rem; }
  .step {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    background: rgba(57,255,20,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57,255,20,0.12);
    border-radius: 5px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .snum {
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.58rem;
    color: #39ff14; flex-shrink: 0;
    font-weight: bold; padding-top: 1px;
  }
  .step p { font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0; }
  .step strong { color: #39ff14; font-weight: 600; }

  /* SVG — 9s loop */
  .droplet-neg {
    animation: drop-appear 9s ease infinite;
  }
  .droplet-pos {
    animation: drop-appear 9s ease infinite, droplet-pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px #39ff14);
  }
  .count-badge {
    animation: count-show 9s ease infinite;
  }

  @keyframes drop-appear {
    0%    { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.4); }
    5%    { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.4); }
    16%   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    96%   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    100%  { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.4); }
  }
  @keyframes droplet-pulse {
    0%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px #39ff14); }
    50%       { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px #39ff14) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(57,255,20,0.5)); }
  }
  @keyframes count-show {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
    72%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    96%     { opacity: 1; }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Pasos de texto — 9s loop */
  @keyframes s1 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    3%      { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    29%     { opacity: 1; }
    33.33%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s2 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    33.33%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    37%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    62%     { opacity: 1; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%    { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s3 {
    0%      { opacity: 0; }
    66.66%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    70%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    96%     { opacity: 1; }
    100%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  }
  .s1 { animation: s1 9s ease infinite; }
  .s2 { animation: s2 9s ease infinite; }
  .s3 { animation: s3 9s ease infinite; }
</style>
